      "title": {
        "en": "Long-standing trust with staff inconsistency"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many long-term clients express deep loyalty to attending veterinarians like Dr. Palmer and Dr. Basa, noting that doctors listen carefully, show genuine warmth, and explain medical choices thoroughly. In contrast, several reviewers report negative interactions with veterinary technicians and management, describing dismissive responses, contradictory instructions, and defensive attitudes."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate handling with critical concerns"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners frequently highlight gentle care for sensitive dogs, temperamental cats, feral rescues, and senior pets facing end-of-life decisions. Reviewers appreciate patient approaches that calm nervous animals. However, other clients express serious distress over perceived lack of urgency, reporting instances where critical pet symptoms worsened or where pets received inadequate physical exams."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "negative",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Concerns over fees and estimates"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pricing and billing transparency generate noticeable dissatisfaction among recent reviewers. Multiple pet owners express frustration over steep follow-up recheck fees, high diagnostic quotes, and lack of upfront price estimates before treatment. While a couple of reviewers consider basic visits reasonably priced, several clients feel costs have escalated significantly beyond community norms."
      }
    }
  ],
